Louis Maller is an agent of [[Org/Concordia/index|Concordia]], the other of the two sent after [[Phenomena/Keystone|keystone 14]]. He came to the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/Prime Meridian Sub Transit Nexus|Sub Transit Nexus]] on 3 March with [[Org/Concordia/People/Crawford Reeves|Crawford Reeves]] and six Happy Time Enforcers, and Reeves read the charter over the Party's heads.

He fought with blasts of sound, one loud enough to leave [[People/Sir Arctos|Arctos]] and [[People/Benny|Benny]] unable to hear. [[People/Johnny|Johnny]] mocked him and put a laughing fit on him that would not stop, and [[People/Anzu|Anzu]] threw him within [[People/Benny|Benny]]'s reach, and Benny ran him through from behind.

His body was searched after the fight. He carried no identification, but he wore boots whose heels were set on actuators and could be detached and fixed to another pair of shoes; the clockwork heels add a spring to the wearer's step. [[People/Benny|Benny]] took them for his own shoes.
